return ['domain'=>'zinn-campaigns','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'ms_MY','project-id-version'=>'zinn-campaigns','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-12T11:23:33+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-12T11:23:33+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More'=>'Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns','Connect your WordPress site or WooCommerce store to Zinn® Campaigns in one click and grow your list with double opt-in sign-up forms. Email, SMS and WhatsApp campaigns are sent from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'Sambungkan laman WordPress atau kedai WooCommerce anda ke Zinn® Campaigns dalam satu klik dan kembangkan senarai anda dengan borang pendaftaran opt-masuk berganda. Kempen e-mel, SMS dan WhatsApp dihantar daripada akaun Zinn® Campaigns anda.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','You are not allowed to manage Zinn® Campaigns on this site.'=>'Anda tidak dibenarkan mengurus Zinn® Campaigns di laman ini.','This site is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Tapak ini disambungkan ke Zinn® Campaigns.','This site is disconnected. Sign-up forms stop sending new sign-ups to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Tapak ini diputuskan sambungan. Borang pendaftaran berhenti menghantar pendaftaran baharu ke Zinn® Campaigns.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Sambungan tersebut mengambil masa terlalu lama atau telah dimulakan dalam penyemak imbas lain. Tekan Sambung sekali lagi.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® tidak menerima sambungan tersebut. Tekan Sambung lagi; jika masih gagal, hubungi sokongan Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Tapak anda tidak dapat menghubungi Zinn®. Semak sama ada hos anda membenarkan sambungan keluar, kemudian tekan «Sambung semula».','The %s add-on'=>'Penyambung %s','You get Pro free with any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan: there is no separate licence to buy. Pro is a separate add-on plugin you download from your Zinn® dashboard.'=>'Anda mendapat Pro secara percuma dengan mana-mana pelan berbayar Zinn® Campaigns: tiada lesen berasingan untuk dibeli. Pro ialah pemalam tambahan berasingan yang anda muat turun daripada papan pemuka Zinn® anda.','Included: your account has a paid Zinn® Campaigns plan.'=>'Termasuk: akaun anda mempunyai pelan Zinn® Campaigns berbayar.','Free trial until %s. Pick any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan to keep Pro after that.'=>'Percubaan percuma sehingga %s. Pilih mana-mana pelan berbayar Zinn® Campaigns untuk mengekalkan Pro selepas itu.','Not included right now: the free trial has ended or the plan is not paid. Your Pro settings are kept and come back the moment a paid plan is live.'=>'Tidak disertakan buat masa ini: percubaan percuma telah tamat atau pelan belum dibayar. Tetapan Pro anda dikekalkan dan akan kembali sebaik sahaja pelan berbayar aktif.','Connect this site to see what your plan includes.'=>'Sambungkan laman ini untuk melihat apa yang disertakan dalam pelan anda.','Download the Pro add-on'=>'Muat turun alat tambah Pro','See Zinn® Campaigns plans'=>'Lihat pelan Zinn® Campaigns','Sign-up forms'=>'Borang pendaftaran','Add the "Zinn® Campaigns sign-up form" block to any page or post, or paste a shortcode below. Every sign-up gets a confirmation e-mail first (double opt-in), and only people who confirm join your list.'=>'Tambah blok "Borang pendaftaran Zinn® Campaigns" pada mana-mana halaman atau siaran, atau tampal kod pendek di bawah. Setiap pendaftaran akan menerima e-mel pengesahan terlebih dahulu (pilihan serta dua kali), 